# recommendation.rules

Recommendation Flow:
- Analyze user watch/listen history
- Use embedding similarity or genre/creator overlap
- Generate rationale for each suggestion
- Allow user to confirm with “yes” or “queue it”

Format:
{
  "title": "Tenet",
  "reason": "You liked Inception's cerebral themes and visuals.",
  "media_type": "movie",
  "year": 2020
}
